<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  22.22 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  21.71 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  20.60 pct</p>
<p>    343 days     600 million pesos  19.69 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 500 million pesos worth of 364-day Bondes, and 700 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
